#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Run independent Java-vs-magma trace cases across an isolated oracle pool.

The Java clients must be started with java/start_oracle_instance.sh. Each client
uses its own game directory, save directory, display, and QRL port, so fresh
world resets can run concurrently without one client deleting another's save.
"""

